    { "id": "q1-desc", "type": "text", "x": 104, "y": 196, "w": 492, "h": 100, "html": "运行于终端 Shell，直接编辑文件、执行命令，可脚本化接入 CI/CD。最深 Harness，最灵活可控。<br><br><span style=\"color:#4f8dff\">代表</span> <span style=\"color:#cbd5e1\">Claude Code · Codex CLI · Aider · Gemini CLI · OpenCode</span>", "fontSize": 13, "color": "#94a3b8", "align": "left", "valign": "top", "lineHeight": 1.65, "group": "A", "fx": { "enter": "fade-up", "order": 2 } },
