    { "id": "q2-desc", "type": "text", "x": 684, "y": 196, "w": 492, "h": 100, "html": "完整独立编辑器（多为 VS Code 分支），内建 Agent、多文件编辑、Tab 补全。一站式沉浸式体验。<br><br><span style=\"color:#a78bfa\">代表</span> <span style=\"color:#cbd5e1\">Cursor · Antigravity · Devin Desktop · Kiro · Zed · Trae</span>", "fontSize": 13, "color": "#94a3b8", "align": "left", "valign": "top", "lineHeight": 1.65, "group": "B", "fx": { "enter": "fade-up", "order": 3 } },
