    { "id": "q3-chip", "type": "text", "x": 490, "y": 352, "w": 106, "h": 26, "html": "EXT", "fontSize": 11, "fontWeight": 700, "color": "#22d3ee", "fontFamily": "'JetBrains Mono', monospace", "align": "right", "valign": "middle", "group": "C" },
    { "id": "q3-desc", "type": "text", "x": 104, "y": 396, "w": 492, "h": 100, "html": "附加到现有编辑器的 AI 助手，保持原有工作流。覆盖面最广，迁移成本最低。<br><br><span style=\"color:#22d3ee\">代表</span> <span style=\"color:#cbd5e1\">GitHub Copilot · Cline · JetBrains Junie · 通义灵码 · Comate</span>", "fontSize": 13, "color": "#94a3b8", "align": "left", "valign": "top", "lineHeight": 1.65, "group": "C", "fx": { "enter": "fade-up", "order": 4 } },
