    { "id": "q4-desc", "type": "text", "x": 684, "y": 396, "w": 492, "h": 100, "html": "异步委派任务 → 沙箱自主工作 → 返回 PR。无需人工看管，适合委派式开发。<br><br><span style=\"color:#34d399\">代表</span> <span style=\"color:#cbd5e1\">Devin · Copilot Cloud Agent · Codex Cloud · Jules · WorkBuddy</span>", "fontSize": 13, "color": "#94a3b8", "align": "left", "valign": "top", "lineHeight": 1.65, "group": "D", "fx": { "enter": "fade-up", "order": 5 } },
